      "content": "That sounds like it might work, but I'm a bit worried about the telematics report. I saw a flag indicating the vehicle speed was way over the limit right before impact. Did you dig into those telemetry logs yet? If we pay out on a speeding violation, won't that be an issue for our audit?",
